  "title": "Jev: A New Safety Judge Resisting Adversarial Attacks",
  "summary": "This report introduces Jev, a novel safety judge that generates no text or labels and only provides a probability for each answer, and presents controlled adversarial evaluation results showing its effectiveness in detecting and resisting specific types of attacks. Jev outperforms other safety judges in certain tasks and is more robust than current defenses in some scenarios.",
  "facts": [
